{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel","id":1370078,"title":"Anima Banner and Caste Mark: Are you a Purist or Rebel?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-24T09:58:00-08:00","id":1370078,"title":"Anima Banner and Caste Mark: Are you a Purist or Rebel?","content":"<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/498704231407288320/681542395925626960/C2123F5D-AE28-46A1-AF03-6654745E7617.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Each Solar caste's write-up in the Corebook has an Anima banner section and the Caste mark of all five Caste are described as golden while the anima banners are also gold/white (save for Twilight who gets all the evening colors), with two or three additional colors as subtle hues tinges.<br /> <br /> So are you a colour purist who only allows the colours written in the book to be anima banner and caste mark, or do you go with whatever colour is thematic and pretty for the character?<br /> <br /> I'm personally a rebel going by my Solar circle which only has one member with a golden banner and caste mark, I can't help but go with different colours for them since I can't resist a colourful lineup, it just seems vastly more exciting than 5 columns of golden light.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T10:10:50-08:00","id":1370083,"title":"","content":"I generally keep to what\u2019s stated in the books. Twilights get a fair bit of colour, others can dip a bit. There\u2019s some leeway, but like a Zenith will never have a brilliant emerald anima, and a Night won\u2019t explode with vivid royal blue. <br /> <br /> The upside is animals aren\u2019t just colour. They can be ethereal ghostly wisps for Nights, or really hard contrasting white-gold and pitch black anti-light for Eclipse castes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T10:27:41-08:00","id":1370086,"title":"","content":"I'd say that I'm a bit of a purist when it comes to the colors of the caste mark (pretty much always gold), and somewhat so about the generic <i>aura</i> of the anima banner (I try to keep it to &quot;sky colors&quot; - so a sky-blue, cloud-grey, or night-black anima is okay, but a grass-green or blood-red one is out). But for the actual iconic image, I'm not a stickler at all. If someone wants to have an iridescent beetle or stunningly multi-colored bird of paradise as their iconic image, it's there, in full living color. It will just be surrounded by an aura of gold or whatever sun color you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T10:30:45-08:00","id":1370089,"title":"","content":"I'm rather a rebel and very flex when it comes to Anima banners. As long as it's cool and thematic, it's fine with me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T10:45:50-08:00","id":1370095,"title":"","content":"I think I also want to keep them a bit closer so as to not step on the toes of some of the other exalted. Like if you want a pure, vibrant green anima, that\u2019s something that an Infernal or a Sidereal might have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T10:56:37-08:00","id":1370098,"title":"","content":"Well, in my last session (session 16 of the game) the Lunar PCs met (and fought) Solars for the first time, who sported caste marks of sunbursts in gold, hellfire green, corpse blue, blood red, etc, so that's me...<br /> <br /> But then, that game has no Infernals or Sidereals so it's not really important to not step on their toes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 02-24-2020, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T11:38:28-08:00","id":1370107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370095#post1370095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I also want to keep them a bit closer so as to not step on the toes of some of the other exalted. Like if you want a pure, vibrant green anima, that\u2019s something that an Infernal or a Sidereal might have.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think in my case I discovered Exalted 3e Core with a very specific read of &quot;Solars have the potential to become anything they want to become&quot;, so I have this very flexible image of the Solar Exalted. Maybe if I played more 2e or had a better idea of what the Exigent were going to be at the time I read 3e for the first time I would think differently but here I am.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T12:15:12-08:00","id":1370114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370107#post1370107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think in my case I discovered Exalted 3e Core with a very specific read of &amp;quot;Solars have the potential to become anything they want to become&amp;quot;, so I have this very flexible image of the Solar Exalted. Maybe if I played more 2e or had a better idea of what the Exigent were going to be at the time I read 3e for the first time I would think differently but here I am.</div> </div> </div> </div>You raise an interesting point actually. Is it just Solars? How would we all feel if a chosen of Battles had a subdued blue colour to their anima? Or a Lunar with one that blazed bright yellow?<br /> <br /> One of the other things might be when I describe a chilling pale silver anima everyone at the table just has that feeling of \u201cLUNAR\u201d in their heads, whereas a trio of Lunars with Red, Blue and Yellow animas wouldn\u2019t do the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T12:27:27-08:00","id":1370118,"title":"","content":"Colour me a purist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T12:34:00-08:00","id":1370120,"title":"","content":"With Caste Marks I tend to be pretty traditional. For me, all my Solars have gold Caste Marks, all my Lunars have silver ones.<br /> <br /> With the animas themselves, I can be a little more open but I still prefer they have colors that make you think of the associated celestial body and the like. But I can accept a Solar with an anima that evokes a brilliant pink sunrise or the thin corona lights of an Eclipse, with a bit more leeway for accents","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T12:44:28-08:00","id":1370123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370114#post1370114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You raise an interesting point actually. Is it just Solars? How would we all feel if a chosen of Battles had a subdued blue colour to their anima? Or a Lunar with one that blazed bright yellow?<br /> <br /> One of the other things might be when I describe a chilling pale silver anima everyone at the table just has that feeling of \u201cLUNAR\u201d in their heads, whereas a trio of Lunars with Red, Blue and Yellow animas wouldn\u2019t do the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think to me it's mainly Solars, but I don't know yet because I have only few experience with other type of Exalted so I have no idea how I would react to them.<br /> <br /> The only DB I played was a Water DB, and his anima was green-browny-murky because it was evoking the terrifying swamps where your enemy can come at you any moment and drag you down to your painful and silent death (I was playing with the White Veil MA and going full &quot;drowning people&quot;), but I never even checked, nor thought of checking, if it was a &quot;legal color&quot; for Water DB.<br /> <br /> Btw I don't see why Chosen of Battles wouldn't have blue in their anima powers. I mean I think I'm not very good with colors, but to me Sidereals are all reminiscent of blueish colors (green, purple, blue, etc ...) when I think about them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":24291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","user":"Chausse","date":". 02-24-2020, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T12:56:16-08:00","id":1370129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370123#post1370123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw I don't see why Chosen of Battles wouldn't have blue in their anima powers. I mean I think I'm not very good with colors, but to me Sidereals are all reminiscent of blueish colors (green, purple, blue, etc ...) when I think about them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Traditionally:<br /> <br /> Mercury/Journeys = Orange<br /> Venus/Serenity = Blue<br /> Mars/Battles = Red<br /> Jupiter/Secrets = Green<br /> Saturn/Endings = Purple<br /> <br /> Sidereal animas also often provoke a feeling of memory in the viewer, I think. Like your Orange Journies anima might be the orange of a long dusky road at sunset, and even though it\u2019s just a colour anyone who sees it knows that\u2019s what it is.<br /> <br /> Also put me in the camp that allows a lot more highlights than I would base colours. A Lunar with a bright silver anima that flickers pink fire at the edges is much more my style.<br /> <br /> Dragonblooded animas are also a bit weird. They\u2019re often depicted in art and descriptions as being basically indistinguishable from actual elements. Like a fire aspect at bonfire just looks like a bonfire, a water aspect just looks like they\u2019re surrounded by and gushing seawater.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 02-24-2020, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T13:05:38-08:00","id":1370131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370114#post1370114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You raise an interesting point actually. Is it just Solars? How would we all feel if a chosen of Battles had a subdued blue colour to their anima? Or a Lunar with one that blazed bright yellow?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think I felt my skin actually crawl at the Sidereal one there so I think I have a lot stronger opinions on that than I thought previously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T13:10:26-08:00","id":1370132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370129#post1370129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Traditionally:<br /> <br /> Mercury/Journeys = Orange<br /> Venus/Serenity = Blue<br /> Mars/Battles = Red<br /> Jupiter/Secrets = Green<br /> Saturn/Endings = Purple<br /> <br /> Sidereal animas also often provoke a feeling of memory in the viewer, I think. Like your Orange Journies anima might be the orange of a long dusky road at sunset, and even though it\u2019s just a colour anyone who sees it knows that\u2019s what it is.<br /> <br /> Also put me in the camp that allows a lot more highlights than I would base colours. A Lunar with a bright silver anima that flickers pink fire at the edges is much more my style.<br /> <br /> Dragonblooded animas are also a bit weird. They\u2019re often depicted in art and descriptions as being basically indistinguishable from actual elements. Like a fire aspect at bonfire just looks like a bonfire, a water aspect just looks like they\u2019re surrounded by and gushing seawater.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't remember for DB the wording but are the anima not reminiscent of something themed by the element of the DB ? I feel like &quot;it's just the element&quot; is a bit plain","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T13:14:25-08:00","id":1370134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370132#post1370132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't remember for DB the wording but are the anima not reminiscent of something themed by the element of the DB ? I feel like &amp;quot;it's just the element&amp;quot; is a bit plain</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a light glow as well as increasing physical looking but technically essence based manifestations of the element. At bonfire an Earth aspect can be shining white while the ground at their feet ripples, cracks and shatters from their seismic force or an iconic form of a crystal forms around them or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T13:46:47-08:00","id":1370138,"title":"","content":"I am colored a Rebel for Anima Banners, and a Purist for Caste Marks.... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","user":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","date":". 02-25-2020, 10:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T13:52:09-08:00","id":1370143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370132#post1370132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't remember for DB the wording but are the anima not reminiscent of something themed by the element of the DB ? I feel like &quot;it's just the element&quot; is a bit plain</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://imgup.motion-twin.com/dinorpg/0/3/9ab97f38_1232096.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Something like this</a> tends to be as common as other things <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/IsQMxdB\" target=\"_blank\">more like this</a>. Or sometimes a mix of the two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T14:56:41-08:00","id":1370157,"title":"","content":"The only one I see with an iconic display is the water one. I mean they are cool but they must vary from one aspect DB to another surely ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T15:07:07-08:00","id":1370158,"title":"","content":"Those animas may not actually be iconic, just burning or base bonfire. When they do go iconic that fire surrounding them may rise up behind them as a Phoenix, or there might be a bright glowing earth dragon or something. It\u2019s just that rather than being a nearly pure display of light an Earth aspect literally has crystal shards whirling around them. That\u2019s what deals 1L/round to everyone nearby.<br /> <br /> Or alternatively it\u2019s just harmful glowing light, it doesn\u2019t really matter much mechanically and in the fluff it\u2019s not consistent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T16:09:42-08:00","id":1370171,"title":"","content":"Count me among the &quot;purist Caste marks, rebel animas&quot; faction.<br /> <br /> I could see a Night or Eclipse or No Moon with an all-black anima, but it would still have to <i>feel different</i> from an Abyssal anima. It would have to have the lustre of obsidian, the warmth of blackened bronze, the velvet sheen of a panther's hide, or some other quality framing the dark hues as essentially <i>Solar</i> or <i>Lunar</i>. Likewise, an Abyssal with a brighter anima would need to have it framed in a sinister or macabre way.<br /> <br /> Exalted with stronger associations between Caste and colour (DBs, Sidereals, Liminals) are a different matter, but even then I feel there's room for creativity. There are a lot of hues to a flame, after all, and to flowers, and even to raw flesh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T18:39:47-08:00","id":1370204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370171#post1370171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted with stronger associations between Caste and colour (DBs, Sidereals, Liminals) are a different matter, but even then I feel there's room for creativity. There are a lot of hues to a flame, after all, and to flowers, and even to raw flesh.</div> </div> </div> </div>DB animas get pretty malleable anyway due to Aura. A pure torch fire anima becomes an erupting volcano in Earth Aura, and a rushing tidal wave of water becomes billowing clouds of steam in Fire Aura. Even like element auras, Fire in Fire aura might turn from orange-yellow into bright blue-white, or twisting vines might explode with blossoms or fruit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T18:51:03-08:00","id":1370206,"title":"","content":"I love playing with the elemental fluff of DB animas, and sometimes tie them into aspect markings. I have a Wood Aspect whose marking includes a certain herbal scent; her anima intensifies and spreads it and ripples like a tree in the breeze, green with flecks of pink. Her Iconic display explodes into a wood dragon spreading its wings and scattering pink petals all around. When her anima flux happens, vague shapes of that same dragon come through in her bonfire anima like a lashing wing or tail.<br /> <br /> I tend to be pretty traditional with caste marks and variously wiggly about anima banners.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T19:40:36-08:00","id":1370213,"title":"","content":"My Sunday group has a pretty diverse circle, but their animas are mostly traditional...<br /> <br /> \u200bExcept IHP's. Hers is of &quot;a great black horse with a mane of violet flames that faintly resemble tentacles. It's reared up on its back legs, front hooves raised in such a way that it is clearly flipping off all of Creation, despite lacking fingers.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T00:22:30-08:00","id":1370262,"title":"","content":"For Caste Mark purist, would you allow an external source to influence its colour? Like turning one red from killing so many living beings for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T00:32:03-08:00","id":1370265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370262#post1370262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For Caste Mark purist, would you allow an external source to influence its colour? Like turning one red from killing so many living beings for example.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not full-on red, but I'd probably be okay with an especially bloodthirsty Dawn's caste mark being <i>slightly </i>ruddier than his gentler Crane Style martial artist buddy's.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T00:55:48-08:00","id":1370268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370262#post1370262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For Caste Mark purist, would you allow an external source to influence its colour? Like turning one red from killing so many living beings for example.</div> </div> </div> </div>Highlights? Sure.<br /> <br /> Colour shift? Nah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T03:36:34-08:00","id":1370291,"title":"","content":"Exalted instilled in me a great appreciation for aesthetic specificity, although I also feel somewhat encouraged to present different Solar Caste animas as more subtle variations on the central visual theme. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370129#post1370129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mercury/Journeys = Orange</div> </div> </div> </div>Yellow, please. Orange is the colour for Endings. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T05:18:00-08:00","id":1370316,"title":"","content":"I'm such a purist that many of my characters even wear the appropriate colour underwear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T06:04:13-08:00","id":1370330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370120#post1370120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can be a little more open but I still prefer they have colors that make you think of the associated celestial body and the like.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this is probably the key thing.<br /> <br /> While I mentioned the bizarre colours of my Solar NPCs, that was a very deliberate inversion. Generally speaking, I think any colour is fine as long as it seems sun-esque. It could be the deep red of twilight, for example, or pure white, or yellow, but not green.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T09:02:25-08:00","id":1370371,"title":"","content":"Anima banners? Caste marks? Celestials\u2014fah!<br /> <br /> Say what you will about the Dragon-Blooded, but at least they know what colors their animas are!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/415-equitable-remedy","name":"Equitable Remedy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar415_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T14:03:52-08:00","id":1370440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Equitable Remedy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370371#post1370371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anima banners? Caste marks? Celestials\u2014fah!<br /> <br /> Say what you will about the Dragon-Blooded, but at least they know what colors their animas are!</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you feel about aspect markings?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T14:13:00-08:00","id":1370442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Equitable Remedy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370371#post1370371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anima banners? Caste marks? Celestials\u2014fah!<br /> <br /> Say what you will about the Dragon-Blooded, but at least they know what colors their animas are!</div> </div> </div> </div>What colour are Water Aspect's animas? \ud83d\ude01","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T14:28:39-08:00","id":1370445,"title":"","content":"90% purist about animal. I personally don't like caste marks at all. Heck, having castes at all for Solars/Abyssals and Lunars is a gamist construct that can be cast away while dealing little to no damage to the setting and freeing up lots of conceptual space for characters to inhabit. I think that means I am rebel on caste mark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T14:35:29-08:00","id":1370447,"title":"","content":"I liked Caste marks when I first played Exalted, and I still like to describe &quot;she bears the Mark of the Anathema upon her brow, showing her vile demonic nature for all to see!&quot; or some such. But the fact that every single Eclipse has the same caste mark, or whatever, has got a bit dull to me.<br /> <br /> I kind of liked the idea behind the Infernal Caste Marks, being completely different, though I didn't like all the designs. Ironically, my least favourite was that of my favourite caste, the Slayers, while my favourite Caste Mark was that of my least-favourite caste, the Defilers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T03:42:24-08:00","id":1370524,"title":"","content":"The way I picture it the bulk of the anima can be whatever but the &quot;base&quot; colour will always show up at like the edges or as the outlines and shading of the iconic manifestation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T04:07:46-08:00","id":1370526,"title":"","content":"I'm more of a purist. I take my freedoms with accents and auxiliary patterns (my last Night's was stroboscopic, while the Dawn's emits violet lightning on occasion), but keep to the base colors for most of the thing, especially caste marks. <br /> <br /> As long as caste marks retain the basic shape and color variance is acceptable, like their size, how they are projected, how solid they feel...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T04:20:57-08:00","id":1370527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370447#post1370447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I liked Caste marks when I first played Exalted, and I still like to describe &quot;she bears the Mark of the Anathema upon her brow, showing her vile demonic nature for all to see!&quot; or some such. But the fact that every single Eclipse has the same caste mark, or whatever, has got a bit dull to me.</div> </div> </div> </div> Personally I find something very compelling in the image of gathering all of the Exalted of one caste together and finding a bunch of diverse eclectic weirdos, but instantly identifiable and unified by the mark upon their brow. <br /> <br /> Maybe it reminds me of the school I went to when I lived in England, today of all days...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 02-26-2020, 07:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T08:06:50-08:00","id":1370556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370527#post1370527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Personally I find something very compelling in the image of gathering all of the Exalted of one caste together and finding a bunch of diverse eclectic weirdos, but instantly identifiable and unified by the mark upon their brow. <br /> <br /> Maybe it reminds me of the school I went to when I lived in England, today of all days...</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.<br /> <br /> I came to WW RPGs at school in England with a bunch of eclectic weirdos.<br /> <br /> There's a lot more to a Solar than their Caste.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T15:00:54-08:00","id":1370661,"title":"","content":"Well, err, I was more alluding to the fact of it being Ash Wednesday.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-26T17:54:28-08:00","id":1370689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel#post1370078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So are you a colour purist who only allows the colours written in the book to be anima banner and caste mark, or do you go with whatever colour is thematic and pretty for the character?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If this question was brought up when I ST my only 'concern' would be that whomever sees the Caste Mark or Anima Banner must know immediately, &amp; without fail, that the character is a specific Cast &amp;/or Exalt.<br /> <br /> The only limit would be the observer's knowledge, but if they accurately reported the info to someone who dose know what of the Caste &amp;/or the Exalt type in question, that person would be able to put 2 &amp; 2 together.<br /> <br /> The logic behind this, for me, is that this is supposed to be the only natural weakness of the Exalted (the Great Curse being a latter add on from outside forces).<br /> <br /> I am all in if a Player wants to be creative, but I think requiring some clearly seen gold to some of the two images is a valid standard.<br /> <br /> BTW, that opening art is amazing. I love everything about it, especially the playful expression of the Solar while he is casually conjuring some Spirit Bomb analog, all with the Anima of koi fish lopping around him in the background. Great stuff.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel#post1370078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/498704231407288320/681542395925626960/C2123F5D-AE28-46A1-AF03-6654745E7617.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>So what's the backstory to this? This is screaming a good setup. Who are these two legendary legends of awesome?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-27T01:29:16-08:00","id":1370715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370661#post1370661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, err, I was more alluding to the fact of it being Ash Wednesday.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Fishing isn't weird!<br /> <br /> (Yesterday, all my troubles seemed so far away...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-27T01:34:53-08:00","id":1370719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370689#post1370689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BTW, that opening art is amazing. I love everything about it, especially the playful expression of the Solar while he is casually conjuring some Spirit Bomb analog, all with the Anima of koi fish lopping around him in the background. Great stuff.<br /> <br /> So what's the backstory to this? This is screaming a good setup. Who are these two legendary legends of awesome?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure the Zenith is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1300312-pretty-daddy-collection-i-e-jen-art-dump-thread\">Theodotus</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-27T02:29:04-08:00","id":1370724,"title":"","content":"My real stance is that I'd sway on it, but I'd like there to be a &quot;logical&quot; in setting reason for it and for it to be a signal of something else, though with quite a bit of leeway. <br /> <br /> The character has mixed unusual essence into their nature (for instance, they're a god blood), they have enchanted the nature of their essence through a working etc.<br /> <br /> Basically I would like the anima light to reflect &quot;real&quot; information about the essence of the Exalt, rather than be *pure* SFX. I like the fact that when supernatural X looks on the anima of a Solar that reflects some color of the sun in its course through the sky, they *know* that this is a Solar (or another Exalt that's gone to a lot of metaphysical trouble to fake it), and it reflects a genuine and meaningful bit of information in the setting.<br /> <br /> (&lt;Vennu Mallesh&gt; I am a Pure Rebel...! &lt;/Vennu Mallesh&gt; )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-28T21:37:01-08:00","id":1371187,"title":"","content":"I am a purist on Castemark and on Anima. When Iconics flare, people get differentiated (except Sidereals, which I think is appropriate given the anonymity themes).<br /> <br /> My 2e upbringing makes me think that the Peripheral mote expenditure of a Solar as being a mini-Daystar, churning the ambient elemental motes of Creation into the Solar motes of their spiritual father the Unconquered Sun to power their Charms that mimic his excellence. And those motes come out sun-yellow, and damn bright (as opposed to Mercury-yellow, and dim). <br /> <br /> Obviously, none of that internal logic or thematics-as-mechanics still holds in 3e besides 'people glow when they burn Peripheral motes', and I can respect a rebel from afar. For the newbies I run with, I've passed on this sameness among the Exalted host, and it seems to jive with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-28T23:25:31-08:00","id":1371198,"title":"","content":"Actually even in 2e the anima wasn\u2019t <i>pure</i> yellow. Dawn might be tinged with reds, Zeniths with white, Twilight with violet, Night with gray, and Eclipse with silver, for instance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-29T12:31:25-08:00","id":1372016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1370689#post1370689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what's the backstory to this? This is screaming a good setup. Who are these two legendary legends of awesome?</div> </div> </div> </div>The fish man is Theodotus, a Zenith, who is having a friendly sparring with one of his Lunar mate.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T00:53:30-08:00","id":1372108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1372016#post1372016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The fish man is Theodotus, a Zenith, who is having a friendly sparring with one of his Lunar mate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it wrong that I can now only hear Theodotus with Masako Nozawa's Goku voice?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T03:57:09-08:00","id":1372124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1372016#post1372016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The fish man is Theodotus, a Zenith, who is having <b>a friendly sparring</b> with one of his Lunar mate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is that Death Ray he\u2019s charging up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T04:01:45-08:00","id":1372125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1372124#post1372124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that Death Ray he\u2019s charging up?</div> </div> </div> </div>My first thought, given the thread topic, was that it was Total Annihilation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T06:51:46-08:00","id":1372145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1372108#post1372108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it wrong that I can now only hear Theodotus with Masako Nozawa's Goku voice?</div> </div> </div> </div>Theodotus's voice isn't so high pitch or hot-blood like that, it's probably more like a male-version of <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/channels/473517739785322496/488381373988732939/683669761498021898\" target=\"_blank\">Sayaka Ohara.</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1372124#post1372124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that Death Ray he\u2019s charging up?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's some type of beam attacks (which he has a lot of). The man just likes to shoot lasers at the enemy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T23:40:23-07:00","id":1373849,"title":"","content":"For me I'm mostly a purist when it comes to Caste Marks, because it's something somewhat important to the setting. Even moreso now that we have Liminals, Getimen, and Exigents added to the mix. Anima Banners I'm not so picky about, appearance of epic imagery I never cared much for either way, and as long as there's some of the 'core' colour to the banner I would be fine with most player personalizations.<br /> <br /> But to return to my main point, the Immaculate Order KNOWS what Solars and Lunars look like, and makes sure the people living around them know it too, mostly through spreading descriptions of their Caste Markings. Because being able to glow Yellow is something that a lot of beings are capable of and you can't expect peasants to be able to tell the finer differences. So it's been a common IC and OOC conceit that most 'glowy-ness' can be explained to the ignorant masses as a side effect of the character being God-Blooded, or even just some other kind of Exalt. But a glowing gold/silver brand upon someone's brow is generally considered bad news by the populace at large.<br /> <br /> The importance goes even further when you consider that Immaculate Monks and other 'experts' don't know what Sidereals are, during the rare times that they get a look at their Caste marks and Anima banners, those details actively being hidden by them. While Abyssals, for all their strangeness and general unfamiliarity when it comes to what the Realm knows about them, were immediately recognized by the Immaculate Order because of their marks. The fact that they glowed with a dark radiance rather than the light of the sun mattered little when their Caste Marks were matched perfectly to those of the legendary Solar Anathema.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12167-broken-masque","name":"Broken Masque","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-10T03:23:34-07:00","id":1373874,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me that some people might be under the impression that <i>all</i> the returned solars are abyssals, and that that's what sealing them away did to them on it's own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-10T04:20:03-07:00","id":1373883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370078-anima-banner-and-caste-mark-are-you-a-purist-or-rebel?p=1373874#post1373874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It occurs to me that some people might be under the impression that <i>all</i> the returned solars are abyssals, and that that's what sealing them away did to them on it's own.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some people, sure.<br /> <br /> But Solars have been appearing sporadically for the entire Second Age. The Immaculate Order/Bronze Faction know The Bull of the North glows Yellow and has a golden dawn on his head.<br /> <br /> I imagine the average citizen of Thorns is just thinking &quot;Anathema!&quot;<br /> <br /> Other people aren't really going to know the difference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}